{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116146",
      "title": "Understanding the OnPush Strategy",
      "lectureOrder": 200,
      "videoOrder": 192,
      "sourceHash": "40606cf38611c4118209b11ab3cac1ffb17def86e6da2bbb82f7561c5e665513",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 4.152,
          "en": "The on push change detection strategy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.152,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "in the end tells Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 10.073,
          "en": "that the component for which you enabled it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.073,
          "end": 14.58,
          "en": "will only ever change because some event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.58,
          "end": 19.29,
          "en": "occurred inside of this sub component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.29,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "So inside of the messages component template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 24.3,
          "en": "or inside of some component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.3,
          "end": 27.39,
          "en": "that's nested in the messages component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.39,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "So inside of the new message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 32.264,
          "en": "or messages list component here in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.264,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "so that an event occurred somewhere in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "or because an input value changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 40.353,
          "en": "in that messages component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.353,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "And here I don't have any input value, so that can't happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.05,
          "en": "But if it had any inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.05,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "then if that input value would change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 50.91,
          "en": "change detection would run for this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.91,
          "end": 52.563,
          "en": "and all child components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.67,
          "end": 55.74,
          "en": "In addition, you could also manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.74,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "trigger change detection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "and I'll get back to that later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 63.09,
          "en": "So it's these three sources in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.09,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "manually triggered change detection,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 69.01,
          "en": "or because an input of the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.886,
          "end": 72.42,
          "en": "where you set on push changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.42,
          "end": 77.1,
          "en": "or because an event occurred anywhere in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 80.30199999999999,
          "en": "or one of its child components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.30199999999999,
          "end": 83.88,
          "en": "And that's why on push can be pretty efficient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.88,
          "end": 87.69,
          "en": "because it limits the amount of events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.69,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "or things that could trigger change detection,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 95.52000000000001,
          "en": "which is why you should strongly consider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.52000000000001,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "using on push in your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "since it can give you that extra performance optimization.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "Of course, using it makes no sense though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 109.11,
          "en": "if you have a very simple application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 111.03,
          "en": "where it simply doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 114,
          "en": "or if you have an application that's so connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "that most changes affect all components anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.095,
          "en": "But if that's not the case on push can be useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.095,
          "end": 124.23,
          "en": "So therefore let's use it a bit more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.23,
          "end": 126.48,
          "en": "to get a better feeling for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.48,
          "end": 129.96,
          "en": "Here I'm using on push in the messages component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.96,
          "end": 133.02,
          "en": "and that already gives us a big improvement here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 135.21,
          "en": "because now it's way less components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.21,
          "end": 138.69,
          "en": "that are checked for changes by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.69,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "And that's happening because the messages component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "where I enabled on push",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.78,
          "end": 147.282,
          "en": "is a sibling to the counter component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.282,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "So interacting with the counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.5,
          "en": "will have no effect on that messages component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.41,
          "end": 154.51,
          "en": "or any sub components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 156.75,
          "en": "Now what happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "if we go to the new message component though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 162.25,
          "en": "where I have that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.14,
          "end": 167.28,
          "en": "and we enable this on push mode here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.28,
          "end": 170.19299999999998,
          "en": "change detection strategy on Push.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.71,
          "end": 176.55,
          "en": "If we do that, and I go back here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.55,
          "end": 178.35,
          "en": "and I change my counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.35,
          "end": 180.63,
          "en": "you'll see the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 182.17,
          "en": "which hopefully makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.228,
          "end": 185.467,
          "en": "because nothing should change there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.467,
          "end": 187.62,
          "en": "We didn't remove on push on the messages component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.62,
          "end": 188.883,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.93,
          "end": 192.753,
          "en": "But what happens now if I type into this message field?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.92,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "Well, if I do that, you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 200.93,
          "en": "that all these components are reevaluated again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.49,
          "en": "On every single keystroke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.49,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "because I'm using two-way binding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 209.88,
          "en": "and therefore, an event is triggered for every keystroke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.88,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "and that triggers change detection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 215.25,
          "en": "Now why does this also have an effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.25,
          "end": 218.13,
          "en": "on the counter component though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.13,
          "end": 219.69,
          "en": "Why does that happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.69,
          "end": 223.773,
          "en": "now that I enabled on push on this new message component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.82,
          "end": 229.2,
          "en": "Well, because on push does not restrict events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.2,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "from affecting other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "Instead all on push does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "is it makes sure that this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 242.28,
          "en": "does not get evaluated unnecessarily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.28,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "But if an event occurs in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "like that keystroke event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.42,
          "end": 250.65,
          "en": "then of course, the parent Components of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.65,
          "end": 254.037,
          "en": "will be notified all the way up to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.037,
          "end": 256.08,
          "en": "and that then will in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.08,
          "end": 259.08299999999997,
          "en": "lead to the entire component tree being checked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.796,
          "end": 262.17,
          "en": "And the only way of changing that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.17,
          "end": 265.05,
          "en": "and potentially improving the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.05,
          "end": 267.18,
          "en": "therefore, is to go to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.18,
          "end": 270.3,
          "en": "where change detection should be avoided,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.3,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "not in the place where the event occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 275.85,
          "en": "So in this case, if the counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 275.85,
          "end": 279.09000000000003,
          "en": "should maybe not be reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 282.42,
          "en": "when we enter text in this message box here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.42,
          "end": 284.94,
          "en": "we have to go to that counter component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.94,
          "end": 287.283,
          "en": "not to the new message component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.48,
          "end": 290.58,
          "en": "So it's here in the counter component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.58,
          "end": 295.33,
          "en": "where we also should consider enabling this on push strategy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.39,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "because with that, this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 305.07,
          "en": "and all its child components will again only be reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.07,
          "end": 307.95,
          "en": "if an event occurs in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 307.95,
          "end": 312.48,
          "en": "or any child component if an input changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 312.48,
          "end": 314.58,
          "en": "And here I have no inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 317.61,
          "en": "or if change detection is triggered manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.61,
          "end": 320.037,
          "en": "which at the moment also doesn't happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.037,
          "end": 322.86,
          "en": "So at the moment, the counter component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.86,
          "end": 326.247,
          "en": "and its child Components should only be reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 326.247,
          "end": 328.47,
          "en": "if an event occurs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 328.47,
          "end": 330.67,
          "en": "So if I click these counter buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 331.63,
          "end": 335.04,
          "en": "and therefore with this change made, if I now reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.04,
          "end": 340.04,
          "en": "and I wait for these timers to expire, you already see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.32,
          "end": 344.37,
          "en": "that almost nothing's going on right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 344.37,
          "end": 347.127,
          "en": "And you can see that if I enter into this message box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 347.127,
          "end": 349.775,
          "en": "the counter component is not part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 349.775,
          "end": 352.42,
          "en": "of these log messages here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 352.42,
          "end": 355.32,
          "en": "neither is this info message component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 355.32,
          "end": 357.6,
          "en": "which is nested in the counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 357.6,
          "end": 361.833,
          "en": "because we enabled on push on that counter component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 362.94,
          "end": 365.16,
          "en": "And we could even take this a step further",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 365.16,
          "end": 367.47,
          "en": "because at the moment if I change the counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 367.47,
          "end": 372.47,
          "en": "the info messages component is also still being checked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 372.69,
          "end": 374.34,
          "en": "and that is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 374.34,
          "end": 377.22,
          "en": "because the info message component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 377.22,
          "end": 379.983,
          "en": "is part of this counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 381,
          "end": 382.564,
          "en": "So it's a child component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 382.564,
          "end": 384.6,
          "en": "and therefore if the counter component changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 384.6,
          "end": 389.37,
          "en": "this also changes, but this doesn't necessarily make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 389.37,
          "end": 390.69,
          "en": "We might wanna avoid this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 390.69,
          "end": 392.88,
          "en": "And therefore in this info message component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 392.88,
          "end": 396.18,
          "en": "we can also set the change detection property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 396.18,
          "end": 399.003,
          "en": "to change detection strategy on push.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 401.25,
          "end": 403.29,
          "en": "And with that, you'll notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 403.29,
          "end": 407.28,
          "en": "that after the timer expired, if I change the counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 407.28,
          "end": 410.733,
          "en": "the info message component is no longer revisited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 411.57,
          "end": 413.73,
          "en": "The app component is because again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 413.73,
          "end": 416.28,
          "en": "those events bubble up in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 416.28,
          "end": 418.17,
          "en": "the parent component of the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 418.17,
          "end": 419.97,
          "en": "that changed is notified,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 419.97,
          "end": 423.9,
          "en": "but the other components are not checked again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 423.9,
          "end": 427.8,
          "en": "And therefore this app now is already much more efficient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 427.8,
          "end": 432.8,
          "en": "than it was before and I'm still not done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 432.99,
          "end": 435.21,
          "en": "I can also go to the messages list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 435.21,
          "end": 437.553,
          "en": "where I now do have an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 438.48,
          "end": 439.576,
          "en": "So the idea here again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 439.576,
          "end": 441.69,
          "en": "would be that it should only be checked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 441.69,
          "end": 446.253,
          "en": "for changes if an event occurred anywhere in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 447.373,
          "end": 448.89,
          "en": "And here I'm not listening to any events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 448.89,
          "end": 450.18,
          "en": "so that shouldn't happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 450.18,
          "end": 453.84000000000003,
          "en": "Or if the input changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 453.84000000000003,
          "end": 456.18,
          "en": "or if change detection was triggered manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 456.18,
          "end": 458.04,
          "en": "which I'm also not doing, but the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 458.04,
          "end": 459.998,
          "en": "of course can change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 459.998,
          "end": 464.4,
          "en": "And therefore here we can also enable change detection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 464.4,
          "end": 468.18,
          "en": "and set this to change detection strategy on push",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 468.18,
          "end": 470.283,
          "en": "in this messages list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 471.75,
          "end": 476.75,
          "en": "And as a result, you'll see that in this application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 476.82,
          "end": 480.21,
          "en": "if I enter text here into this text box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 480.21,
          "end": 485.21,
          "en": "the messages list component is not being evaluated anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 486.63,
          "end": 488.907,
          "en": "And previously that was the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 488.907,
          "end": 492.753,
          "en": "but it is reevaluated if I save that message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 494.07,
          "end": 496.41,
          "en": "then you see that log here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 496.41,
          "end": 500.25,
          "en": "where messages list is being checked, which makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 500.25,
          "end": 502.53,
          "en": "because it's input value changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 502.53,
          "end": 504.453,
          "en": "once the message is being saved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 506.04,
          "end": 509.31,
          "en": "And that's how this on push strategy works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 509.31,
          "end": 512.46,
          "en": "why it's a powerful tool and why you therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 512.46,
          "end": 515.643,
          "en": "should consider using it in your components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
